  ],
  "solution": "<p>Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>&#x0003E;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></math>. Then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>&#x02212;</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>u</mi><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00028;</mo><mi>u</mi><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00029;</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow></math>.</p><p>Because a real square is nonnegative, the expression is at least <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow></math>. Equality occurs at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></math>, and this is attained when <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></math>. The minimum is therefore <strong><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow></math>, option B.</strong></p>",
